# Attribution

The name-coloring / cosmetics feature in this mod is based on code
originally written by Eclipse-5214 for their mod, Stella:
https://github.com/Eclipse-5214/stella

Eclipse-5214 gave permission to use and adapt this code here.

- `MixinFont.java` (in com.cbza.net.mixin) is very close to the
  original, just repointed at this mod's package. It lives outside
  this folder because Fabric's mixin loader requires it to sit in
  the main mixin package.
- `Cosmetics.java` here is based on Stella's core idea of intercepting
  and recoloring chat text, but the UUID lookup, JSON fetching, and
  gradient support were rewritten for this mod.
- `NameData.java` was inspired by a similar data class Eclipse-5214
  shared alongside the above, extended here with gradients.

Thanks to Eclipse-5214 for letting me build on his work.